## Implementation pattern

- Unit selection: [`apps/mobile/tile-merge/game/ads/rewarded.ts`](apps/mobile/tile-merge/game/ads/rewarded.ts) — `getRewardedAdUnitId()` returns test IDs unless `EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_PRODUCTION_ADS=true`.
- EAS: `preview` profile has no production flag; `production` profile sets `EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_PRODUCTION_ADS=true` in [`eas.json`](apps/mobile/tile-merge/eas.json).
- Wrap SDK behind `game/ads/*` — never call `react-native-google-mobile-ads` directly from UI.

## When implementing ads in any mobile app

- Add `__DEV__` or env-guard before wiring real unit IDs.
- Mock `game/ads/*` in Jest — do not load native modules in unit tests.
- Document ad testing steps in the app's `PLAY_STORE.md` or README.
